## Communications
## Zeolitic Imidazolate Frameworks
Controlling Dissolution and Transformation of Zeolitic Imidazolate Frameworks by using Electron-Beam-Induced Amorphization
Scanning-electron-beam-induced amorphization of zeolitic imidazolate framework L with control at the submicrometer scale occurs without loss of
macroscopic integrity and entails a significant increase in water stability, which gives access to novel morphologies of the amorphized product.
